<Layout title="Privacy Policy - UK Trade Websites" description="How UK Trade Websites collects and uses information sent through our website." path="/privacy-policy/">
<section class="legacy-hero legacy-privacy">
  <svg class="legacy-wave" viewBox="0 0 1440 900" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="#FF8C42" d="M0,0 H1440 V900 H1415 C1190,680 989,329 819,198 C766,160 727,151 696,165 C596,224 554,337 450,350 C260,390 124,590 0,875 Z"/></svg>
  <div class="container legacy-privacy-content">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="privacy-date">Last updated:16.03.26</p>
<p>UK Trade Websites ("we", "our", or "us") respects your privacy and is committed to protecting your personal data. This policy explains how we collect, use and protect any information you provide when using our website.</p>
<h2>1. Information We Collect</h2><p>We may collect the following information when you contact us through our website:</p><ul><li>Your name</li><li>Email address</li><li>Phone number</li><li>Business details you choose to provide</li><li>Any information submitted through our contact form</li></ul><p>We only collect information necessary to respond to your enquiry or provide our services.</p>
<h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2><p>We use your information to:</p><ul><li>Respond to enquiries</li><li>Provide website services</li><li>Communicate with you about your request</li><li>Improve our services</li></ul><p>We do not sell or share your personal information with third parties for marketing purposes.</p>
<h2>3. How We Store Your Information</h2><p>Any personal information you provide is stored securely and only accessed by authorised individuals.</p><p>We retain your information only for as long as necessary to respond to your enquiry or provide our services.</p>
<h2>4. Cookies</h2><p>Our website may use cookies to improve your browsing experience and analyse website traffic.</p><p>Cookies are small files stored on your device that help websites function effectively.</p><p>You can disable cookies through your browser settings if you prefer.</p>
<h2>5. Third-Party Services</h2><p>We may use trusted third-party services to help operate our website, such as:</p><ul><li>Website hosting providers</li><li>Website analytics tools</li></ul><p>These providers only process data necessary to perform their services.</p>
<h2>6. Your Data Rights</h2><p>Under UK data protection law, you have the right to:</p><ul><li>Request access to the personal data we hold about you</li><li>Request correction of inaccurate information</li><li>Request deletion of your personal data</li></ul><p>To make a request, please contact us using the details below.</p>
<h2>7. Contact Us</h2><p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy or how your data is handled, you can contact us at:</p><p>Email: <a href="mailto:uktradewebsites@gmail.com">uktradewebsites@gmail.com</a><br/>Website: <a href="https://uktradewebsites.co.uk/">https://uktradewebsites.co.uk/</a></p>
<h2>8. Changes to This Policy</h2><p>We may update this policy occasionally. Any updates will be posted on this page.</p>
</div></section>
